    "font" : "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Let δr : C → C be the scaling map given by δr(z) = r·z and denote by η: S2 → S2 the conformal diffeomorphism agreeing with ϱ ◦ δr ◦ ψ on S2 \\ {p+}. It follows from (2.1) and (2.2) that"
